OL,3,GNEWSAProject to help tourism sector
OL,4,Abenefit from AI
OL,5,
OL,6,FA project has been launched to help the
OL,7,Ftourism industry benefit from advances
OL,8,Fin artificial intelligence (AI).
OL,10,FThe University of Plymouth said the
OL,11,F#275,000 project would allow students
OL,12,Fand graduates to work with people in
OL,13,Ftourism on a "range of exciting
OL,14,Finitiatives".
OL,16,FRong Huang, programme lead in tourism
OL,17,Fand hospitality at Plymouth Business
OL,18,FSchool, said: "This project brings our
OL,19,Fstudents, our industry partners and
OL,20,Fregional employers together so that
OL,21,Flearning happens on live business
OL,22,Fchallenges."
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
