OL,3,GNEWSAProject to help tourism sector
OL,4,Abenefit from AI
OL,5,
OL,6,FClaire Steiner, from the Institute of
OL,7,FTravel and Tourism, added: "AI is
OL,8,Fchanging how we work in travel and
OL,9,Ftourism, and we need to make sure
OL,10,Fpeople have the skills and confidence
OL,11,Fto use it well."
